msgid "Parallel plate schematic"
msgstr "Esquema de placas paralelas"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:432
msgid ""
"A fluid flowing from left to right due to a pressure gradient results in "
"wall shear on the parallel plates. This flow profile is for the case when "
"the pressure gradient is negative."
msgstr ""
"Un fluido que fluye de izquierda a derecha debido a un gradiente de presión "
"provoca un corte de pared en las placas paralelas. Este perfil de flujo es "
"para el caso en que el gradiente de presión es negativo."

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:435
msgid "We start with the Navier-Stokes equation written for flow in the x direction."
msgstr ""
"Comenzamos con la ecuación de Navier-Stokes escrita para el flujo en la "
"dirección x."

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:437
msgid "\\frac{y^2}{2} \\frac{dp}{dx} + Ay + B = \\mu u"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:441
msgid "where :math:`u` is the velocity in the x direction."
msgstr "donde :math:`u` es la velocidad en la dirección x."

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:443
msgid "Apply the no slip condition at bottom plate."
msgstr "Aplica la condición de no deslizamiento en la placa inferior."

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:445
msgid "u=0 \\quad at \\quad y=0"
msgstr "u=0 \\quad at \\quad y=0"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:449
msgid "Thus the constant :math:`B=0`."
msgstr "Así, la constante :math:`B=0`."

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:451
msgid "Apply the no slip condition at top plate."
msgstr "Aplica la condición de no deslizamiento en la placa superior."

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:453
msgid "u=0 \\quad at \\quad y=S"
msgstr "u=0 \\quad at \\quad y=S"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:457
msgid "Thus the constant :math:`A = \\frac{- S}{2} \\frac{dp}{dx}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:459
msgid ""
"Substitute the values for constants :math:`A` and :math:`B` into the "
"original equation."
msgstr ""
"Sustituye los valores por constantes :math:`A` y :math:`B` en la ecuación "
"original."

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:461
msgid "\\frac{y^2}{2} \\frac{dp}{dx} - \\frac{S}{2} \\frac{dp}{dx} y = \\mu \\,u"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:465
msgid "Simply the equation to obtain"
msgstr "Simplemente la ecuación para obtener"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:467
msgid "u = \\frac{y \\left( y - S \\right)}{2 \\mu} \\frac{dp}{dx}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:471
msgid ""
"We need a relationship between average velocity and :math:`\\frac{dp}{dx}`. "
"We can obtain this by integrating from 0 to :math:`S`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:474
msgid ""
" {\\bar v } = \\frac{q}{S}\n"
" = \\frac{1}{S}\\int\\limits_0^S u dy\n"
" = \\frac{1}{S} \\int\\limits_0^S\n"
"\\left(\n"
"\\frac{y^2 - S y}{2 \\mu} \\left( \\frac{dp}{dx} \\right)\n"
"\\right) dy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:483
msgid "\\bar v = - \\frac{S^2}{12 \\mu} \\frac{dp}{dx}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:487
msgid "Solving for :math:`\\frac{dp}{dx}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:489
msgid "\\frac{dp}{dx} = - \\frac{12 \\mu \\bar v}{S^2}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:493
msgid "From the Navier Stokes equation after integrating once we get"
msgstr "A partir de la ecuación de Navier-Stokes tras integrar una vez que obtenemos"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:495
msgid "\\mu \\,\\left( \\frac{du}{dy} \\right) = y \\frac{dp}{dx} + A"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:499
msgid ""
"Substituting our boundary condition, :math:`A = \\frac{- S}{2} "
"\\frac{dp}{dx}` we obtain"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:502
msgid "\\frac{du}{dy}_{y = 0} = - \\frac{S}{2 \\mu} \\frac{dp}{dx}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:506
msgid "Substituting the result for :math:`\\frac{dp}{dx}` we obtain"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:508
msgid "\\frac{du}{dy}_{y = 0} = \\frac{6 \\bar v}{S}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:512
msgid "Therefore in velocity gradient notation we have"
msgstr "Por lo tanto, en la notación de gradiente de velocidad tenemos"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:514
msgid "G_{wall} = \\frac{6 \\bar v}{S}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:518
msgid "The energy dissipation rate at the wall"
msgstr "La tasa de disipación de energía en la pared"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:520
msgid ""
"\\varepsilon_{wall} = G_{wall}^2 \\nu\n"
"\n"
msgstr "\\varepsilon_{wall} = G_{wall}^2 \\nu"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:522
msgid "\\varepsilon_{wall} = \\left( \\frac{6 \\bar v}{S}\\right)^2 \\nu"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:526
msgid ""
"Head loss due to shear on the plates is obtained from a force balance on a "
