"paralelas, como se muestra en :numref:`figure_Parallel_Plate_schematic`."

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:528
msgid "A force balance on a control volume gives"
msgstr "Un balance de fuerzas en un volumen de control da"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:530
msgid "2 \\tau L W = -\\Delta P W S"
msgstr "2 \\tau L W = -\\Delta P W S"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:534
msgid "\\Delta P = -\\frac{2 \\tau L}{S}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:538
msgid "The equation relating shear and velocity gradient is"
msgstr "La ecuación que relaciona el cizallamiento y el gradiente de velocidad es"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:540
msgid "\\tau = \\nu \\rho \\frac{du}{dy} = \\nu \\rho G"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:544
msgid "The velocity gradient at the wall is"
msgstr "El gradiente de velocidad en la pared es"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:546
msgid " G_{wall} = \\frac{6 \\bar v}{S}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:551
msgid "\\tau  = \\nu \\rho \\frac{6 \\bar v}{S}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:555
msgid "Substituting into the force balance equation"
msgstr "Sustituyendo en la ecuación de equilibrio de fuerzas"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:557
msgid "\\Delta P = -\\frac{2 \\nu \\rho 6 \\bar v L}{S^2}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:561
msgid "The head loss for between parallel plates at uniform velocity simplifies to"
msgstr ""
"La pérdida de carga para entre placas paralelas a velocidad uniforme se "
"simplifica a"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:563
msgid " h_{{\\rm f}} = \\frac{-\\Delta P}{\\rho g}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:568
msgid "h_{{\\rm f}} = 12\\frac{ \\nu \\bar v L}{gS^2}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:572
#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:628
msgid "The average energy dissipation rate is"
msgstr "La tasa media de disipación de energía es"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:578
msgid "\\bar\\varepsilon = 12 \\nu \\left(\\frac{  \\bar v}{S} \\right)^2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:582
msgid "The Camp-Stein velocity gradient for laminar flow between parallel plates is"
msgstr ""
"El gradiente de velocidad de Camp-Stein para el flujo laminar entre placas "
"paralelas es"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:584
msgid "\\tilde{G} = 2\\sqrt{3}\\frac{  \\bar v}{S}"
