#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1110
msgid ""
"where Q is the flow rate, S is the distance between baffles, and W is the "
"width of the flow. The velocity of the jet (the contracted flow) is obtained"
