"partir de la continuidad."

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1112
msgid "\\bar v_{Jet} = \\frac{\\bar v}{\\Pi_{VCBaffle}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1116
msgid "where :math:`\\Pi_{VCBaffle}` is the *vena contracta* for the 180° bend."
msgstr "donde :math:`\\Pi_{VCBaffle}` es el *vena contracta* para la curva de 180°."

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1118
msgid "S_{Jet} = S \\Pi_{VCBaffle}"
msgstr "S_{Jet} = S \\Pi_{VCBaffle}"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1122
msgid ""
"The average hydraulic residence time for the fluid between two baffles is "
"given by"
msgstr ""
"El tiempo medio de residencia hidráulica del fluido entre dos deflectores "
"está dado por"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1124
msgid "\\theta_B = \\frac{H}{\\bar v}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1128
msgid ""
"where :math:`H` is the depth of water. Substituting into the equation for "
":math:`\\varepsilon_{max}` to get the equation in terms of the average "
"velocity :math:`\\bar v` and flow dimension :math:`S`"
msgstr ""
"donde :math:`H` es la profundidad del agua. Sustituyendo en la ecuación para"
" :math:`\\varepsilon_{max}` obtener la ecuación en términos de la velocidad "
"media :math:`\\bar v` y la dimensión del flujo :math:`S`"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1130
msgid ""
"\\varepsilon_{max}= \\frac{\\Pi_{FlocBaffle}}{S \\Pi_{VCBaffle}} \\left( "
"\\frac{ \\bar v}{\\Pi_{VCBaffle}} \\right)^3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1134
msgid "From the control volume analysis the average energy dissipation rate is"
msgstr ""
"Según el análisis de volumen de control, la tasa media de disipación de "
"energía es"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1136
msgid ""
"\\bar \\varepsilon = K \\frac{\\bar v^2}{2} \\frac{1}{\\theta_B} = "
"\\frac{K}{2} \\frac{\\bar v^3}{H_e}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1140
msgid ""
"where :math:`K` is the minor loss coefficient for flow around the end of a "
"baffle with a :math:`180^\\circ` turn."
msgstr ""
"donde :math:`K` es el coeficiente de pérdida menor para el flujo alrededor "
"del extremo de un deflector con una vuelta :math:`180^\\circ` ."

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1142
msgid ""
"Substitute the values for :math:`\\bar \\varepsilon` and "
":math:`\\varepsilon_{max}` to obtain the ratio, :math:`\\Pi_{\\bar "
"\\varepsilon}^{\\varepsilon_{max}}`"
msgstr ""
"Sustituyamos los valores de :math:`\\bar \\varepsilon` y "
":math:`\\varepsilon_{max}` para obtener la razón, :math:`\\Pi_{\\bar "
"\\varepsilon}^{\\varepsilon_{max}}`"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1146
msgid ""
"\\Pi_{\\bar \\varepsilon}^{\\varepsilon_{max}} = "
"\\frac{\\Pi_{FlocBaffle}}{\\Pi_{VCBaffle}^4} \\frac{2 H_e}{K S}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1150
msgid ""
":math:`\\Pi_{\\bar \\varepsilon}^{\\varepsilon_{max}}` has a value of 2 for "
":math:`H_e/S <5` (CFD analysis and `Haarhoff, 2001 <https://search-proquest-"
"com.proxy.library.cornell.edu/docview/1943098053?accountid=10267>`__) The "
"transition value for :math:`H_e/S` is at 5 (from CFD analysis, our weakest "
"assumption)."
msgstr ""
":math:`\\Pi_{\\bar \\varepsilon}^{\\varepsilon_{max}}` tiene un valor de 2 "
"para :math:`H_e/S <5` (análisis CFD y `Haarhoff, 2001 <https://search-"
"proquest-"
"com.proxy.library.cornell.edu/docview/1943098053?accountid=10267>`__). El "
"valor de transición para :math:`H_e/S` es 5 (según análisis CFD, nuestra "
"suposición más débil)."

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1154
msgid ""
"We also have that :math:`\\Pi_{\\bar \\varepsilon}^{\\varepsilon_{max}}` has"
" a value of :math:`\\frac{\\Pi_{FlocBaffle}}{\\Pi_{VCBaffle}^4} \\frac{2 "
"H_e}{K S}` for :math:`H_e/S>5`. Thus we can solve for "
":math:`\\Pi_{FlocBaffle}` at :math:`H_e/S=5`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1159
msgid ""
"\\Pi_{FlocBaffle} \\approx \\left(\n"
"\\Pi_{\\bar \\varepsilon}^{\\varepsilon_{max}} \\Pi_{VCBaffle}^4 "
"\\frac{K}{2} \\frac{S}{H_e}\n"
"\\right)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1165
msgid "\\Pi_{FlocBaffle} \\approx 0.0124"
msgstr "\\Pi_{FlocBaffle} \\aprox. 0,0124"

#: ../../Fluid_Deformation_and_Energy_Dissipation/FDED_Derivations.rst:1169
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This value for :math:`\\Pi_{FlocBaffle}` is lower than we estimated based on"
" 50% of the :math:`\\Pi_{JetPlane}`. Additional research is needed to "
"measure :math:`\\Pi_{FlocBaffle}`."
msgstr ""
"Este valor para :math:`\\Pi_{FlocBaffle}` es menor de lo que estimamos "
"basándonos en el 50% de la :math:`\\Pi_{JetPlane}`. Se necesita "
"investigación adicional para medir :math:`\\Pi_{FlocBaffle}`."

